Move the HTTP details into a **typed API adapter**, the multi-call workflow into a **provisioning facade**, and test-data lifecycle management into a **Playwright fixture**. Keep UI interactions in a **Page Object**.

This provides separation of responsibilities without introducing unnecessary inheritance or claiming that every SOLID principle requires its own abstraction.

