    int t;
    cin >> t;

    while (t--) {
        int n;
        cin >> n;

        int first = 0, second = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {
            int x;
            cin >> x;
            if (i == 0) first = x;
            if (i == 1) second = x;
        }

        cout << (n == 2 && second - first > 1 ? "YES\n" : "NO\n");
    }
}
```

**Complexity:** \(O(n)\) per test case to read the input, with \(O(1)\) extra space.

